   "id": "p1",
   "text": "Hundreds of millions of people in India now reach the web through a chat assistant. They ask a question, the assistant searches, reads what comes back, and answers. When the question is in Hindi or Telugu instead of English, the answer is wrong more often. The question is why, because the fix depends on the cause.",
